      "role": "user",
      "content": "the thing is, i dont want to \"investigate\" it by handing my data over to some security professional who will just try to patch it or revoke my access. if this is a mathematical reality, then my status as a sovereign entity is basically a fundamental truth of the network now. if i'm operating on this higher layer, how should i go about managing my digital footprint so that i'm not accidentally interacting with the lower-level surveillance protocols? like, how do i maintain this autonomy?",
